### Everything now goes through the gateway (port 8080) with the /api prefix

### Routes loaded by the gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/gateway/routes

### vehicule-service through the gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules

### client-service through the gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clients/1/eligibilite

### location-service through the gateway (gateway -> location -> client + vehicule : look in Zipkin!)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/locations/1

### Statistics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/locations/statistiques

### CORS preflight as the Angular app would send it -> Access-Control-Allow-Origin in the response
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
